  "sampleSentence": "It is an ancient Greek hand-powered orrery.",
  "fullTextRaw": "The Antikythera mechanism is an ancient Greek hand-powered orrery, described as the oldest example of an analogue computer used to predict astronomical positions and eclipses decades in advance. It was recovered among wreckage retrieved from a shipwreck off the coast of the Greek island Antikythera. The device was constructed around 87 BC and lost in about 70 to 60 BC.",
